# AWS Lambda / API Gateway

See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md`.

## MUST

- Message max 2000; history max 5 with validated roles/content
- Claude service errors → handler **502**
- Keep stage MethodSettings throttle (5 / 10) unless product changes it
- Update `api.yaml` when HTTP contracts change
- Bump API `DeploymentNonce` when forcing API Gateway redeploy

## MUST NOT

- Return Claude failures as 200
- Log full API Gateway events
- Collapse CFN stacks without a migration plan
